    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, a sovereign platform called Atelier, which forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents and associated services address many of the client's requirements, including improvement of efficiency and quality of care, reduction of complexity of procedures, simplification of access to information sources, decrease of administrative and documentation work, increase of time available for patient care, facilitation of access to information, improvement of quality of written outputs, and reduction of processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that must be accessible from the hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff in clinical-administrative activities, fit into existing practices of staff, not introduce a rupture in clinical or administrative workflows, let staff access reliable up-to-date information, adapt generated content to the clinical-administrative context, conform generated content to expected quality standards, support medical coding for activity reporting (PMSI, ICD-10), take into account dossier context where available, provide response times compatible with daily clinical use, achieve response time below 2 seconds for common queries, ensure high level of availability including 24/7 services, integrate with existing SIH, DPI, HL7, FHIR, INS, and national framework." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also integrate with user directories, rely on low-carbon infrastructure, contribute to reducing energy consumption, and minimize total cost." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What is the proposed technical architecture for The solution, and how does the proposed technical architecture for our AI assistance solution meet the proposed technical architecture for our AI assistance solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, proposes a technical architecture based on Our company, Faber IA Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform consists of several components, including a document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer with hybrid search, orchestration layer, and answer layer. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can be containerized using Kubernetes, ensuring scalability and flexibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, Our company, Faber IA will deploy Our company, Faber IA solution on the Sovereign HDS tier, which is hosted by OuraneCloud and meets the necessary security and regulatory standards, including SecNumCloud qualification and HDS certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures data sovereignty and compliance with GDPR regulations, as all data will be hosted exclusively within the European Union. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform is model-agnostic, allowing Our company, Faber IA to choose the most suitable model for the task at hand." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA can utilize Our company, Faber IA sovereign European open-weight model, which provides strong grounding and citation behavior, or top-tier proprietary models accessed via API, depending on the specific requirements of the project. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform architecture allows our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform to integrate with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI) through API-type interfaces, supporting health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can integrate with user directories using SAML, OIDC, LDAP, or Entra ID, ensuring seamless authentication and authorization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has a median latency of 1.3 seconds, with common queries achieving response times below 2 seconds at p95." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Complex multi-source synthesis queries may reach up to 2.5 seconds at p95." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA solution is designed to scale horizontally with additional inference capacity, ensuring high availability and meeting the client's requirement for 24/7 services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA hosting option on the Sovereign HDS tier relies on renewable-powered infrastructure, contributing to reducing energy consumption and minimizing the environmental footprint of The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, Our company, Faber IA solution is designed to optimize costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service, aligning with the client's budget constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, Our company, Faber IA proposed technical architecture meets the client's technical requirements by providing a scalable, secure, and performant AI assistance solution that integrates seamlessly with existing hospital systems, ensures data sovereignty, and minimizes environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance, protection of personal and health data, guaranteeing that health data is processed as special category data under GDPR Art. 9, hosting data exclusively within the European Union, not transferring data outside the European Union, protecting sensitive data with encryption or pseudonymisation where relevant, holding French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification for infrastructure hosting the solution, ensuring explainable recommendations or suggestions produced by the solution, and providing source grounding and audit trail for outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the security and compliance measures in place to ensure our AI assistance solution meets these regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, has implemented various security and compliance measures to address The client regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA hold ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of Our company, Faber IA services, including data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Our company, Faber IA have ISO 27701 certification, which is an extension for privacy information management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA also hold HDS certification through Our company, Faber IA hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, ensuring that Our company, Faber IA processing on our hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud is covered." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, OuraneCloud has SecNumCloud qualification at the hosting layer." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of data protection measures, Our company, Faber IA use encryption in transit with TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest with AES-256." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA also utilize the European Union-based infrastructure for key management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pseudonymisation and data minimization are implemented, along with configurable retention and strict tenant isolation between client corpora, including per-engagement logical separation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA role-based access control (RBAC) and audit logging of access and system outputs provide further security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register, with a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) available that aligns with GDPR Article 28." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our AI assistance solution, Atelier, is designed to provide explainable outputs, with features such as source grounding and audit logs, supporting medical confidentiality and traceability." ;
